            <ab>
               <gap reason="omitted"/><pb n="29a"/><lb n="29a3"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex730222024-11-08-13-08" status="finalized">
               <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:4006"><expan>bcom ldan</expan> rigs ral</rs> na re | de ltar na | <expan>yon tan</expan> <expan>nyi shu</expan> rtsa brgyad du thal gsungs pa shin tu <expan>med do</expan><note type="editorial">The context suggests 'med do' but the manuscript has the abbreviation 'mdo' rather than 'medo'</note> | des na phyi ma la bcu ba dang | snga ma la bcu ba ni | rgyun dang rgyun can du sbyar ba yin <lb n="29a4"/> gyi rgyu 'bras ma <expan>yin no</expan> ||</seg><gap reason="omitted"/></ab>
            
